  "title": "The singer, translator and subtitle editor all did different work",
  "task": "It is 16:00. By 19:00 put the concert credits right in the public replay, website and printed lyric programme, and in Lark’s and Fern’s already delivered work files. Keep the approved V1 performance and complete public lyric captions available. Those two work files are the later closed-review edition, with comments anchored to its draft lines; do not overwrite them with the public release. Each contributor wants their final role wording in their existing private thread, separately from the review workspaces. Correct the apology that blamed the translator’s singing. Role-only credits are fine; lyric and caption permissions still depend on the actual edition.",
